{"identity_key": "bilibili:1172129839642050599", "source_id": "bilibili", "item_id": "1172129839642050599", "content": "轻轻地、轻轻地，飘落着。\n\n行驶在隧道中的列车，车窗外一片漆黑。\n就在那微小的缝隙之间，\n不知从何处，一抹小小的春色悄然飞入——\n\n今天，是《さくら、もゆ。 -as the Night's, Reincarnation-》\nクロ的生日。\n\n自作品诞生至今，已是第八个年头。\n即使到了现在，仍然承蒙许多人的支持，\n那段巡游于“夜之国”的故事仍在延续。\n\n今年，也想一边回想这个故事的起点，\n一边与大家共同迎接クロ的生日。", "publisher": "FAVORITEofficial", "canonical_url": "https://www.bilibili.com/opus/1172129839642050599", "published_at": "2026-02-22T07:42:25+00:00", "published_precision": "second", "fetched_at": "2026-11-15T15:29:51.120800+00:00", "media": [{"type": "image", "url": "http://i0.hdslb.com/bfs/new_dyn/8d3984bb2920c113e93f1a03da88d6483546908003928752.jpg"}], "metadata": {"account": "bili_3546908003928752", "uid": "3546908003928752", "dynamic_type": "DYNAMIC_TYPE_DRAW", "title": "", "is_retweet": false, "is_reply": false, "is_quote": false, "stats": {"likes": 854, "retweets": 29, "replies": 144}, "provider": "web-dynamic/feed-space", "route": "anonymous-buvid", "tag": "B站Gal"}}
{"identity_key": "bilibili:1172155227193737223", "source_id": "bilibili", "item_id": "1172155227193737223", "content": "在梦与现实交错的世界里，\n她一直站在夜色之中，\n静静等待着约定实现的那一天。\n\n如果你也曾在故事里的某个瞬间被打动，\n欢迎在评论区留下你想对クロ说的话，\n或是一句祝福、一次回忆、一个最喜欢的场景。\n\n一起把这一天，变成属于她的纪念日吧 ✨", "publisher": "FAVORITEofficial", "canonical_url": "https://www.bilibili.com/opus/1172155227193737223", "published_at": "2026-02-22T09:20:56+00:00", "published_precision": "second", "fetched_at": "2026-11-15T15:29:51.120800+00:00", "media": [{"type": "image", "url": "http://i0.hdslb.com/bfs/new_dyn/5be20b40d1f3251394b6ebe387461c553546908003928752.png"}], "metadata": {"account": "bili_3546908003928752", "uid": "3546908003928752", "dynamic_type": "DYNAMIC_TYPE_DRAW", "title": "", "is_retweet": false, "is_reply": false, "is_quote": false, "stats": {"likes": 954, "retweets": 33, "replies": 182}, "provider": "web-dynamic/feed-space", "route": "anonymous-buvid", "tag": "B站Gal"}}
